<title>USA: J. Ray McDermott president/COO resigns.</title>
<headline>J. Ray McDermott president/COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>J. Ray McDermott SA said Monday that president and chief operating officer Mike Lam has resigned.</p>
<p>Chairman James Dutt said the company will immediately begin to identify candidates to succeed Lam.</p>
<p>Lam had been president and chief operating officer since September 1996. No reason was given for his departure.</p>
</text>
